      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. i was also thinking about how the value drops so predictably every year. does it ever make sense to use a different method if the machine actually loses value way faster in the first few years instead of this even split? like what would be the pros and cons of doing that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
